{"seq":5,"slug":"lc0206-reverse-linked-list","title":"LeetCode 206 反转链表","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/leetcode-practice/easy-linked-list-stack-queue/lc0206-reverse-linked-list","wordCount":637,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"leetcode-206-反转链表\">LeetCode 206 反转链表</h1><h2 id=\"题目描述\">题目描述</h2><p>给你单链表的头节点 <code>head</code>，请你反转链表，并返回反转后的链表。</p>\n<p><strong>约束条件：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>链表中节点的数目范围是 <code>[0, 5000]</code></li>\n<li><code>-5000 &lt;= Node.val &lt;= 5000</code></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>示例 1：</strong></p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"输入：head = [1,2,3,4,5]&#10;输出：[5,4,3,2,1]\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>输入：head = [1,2,3,4,5]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>输出：[5,4,3,2,1]</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>示例 2：</strong></p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"输入：head = [1,2]&#10;输出：[2,1]\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>输入：head = [1,2]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>输出：[2,1]</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>示例 3：</strong></p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"输入：head = []&#10;输出：[]\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>输入：head = []</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>输出：[]</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"解题思路\">解题思路</h2><p>反转链表是链表操作中最高频的面试题之一，也是许多复杂链表问题（如 LC #25 K 个一组翻转链表、LC #92 反转链表 II）的核心子操作。</p>\n<p><strong>方法一：迭代（三指针）</strong></p>\n<p>迭代法的核心是使用三个指针逐步翻转每个节点的 <code>next</code> 指向：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><code>prev</code> 初始为 <code>null</code>，代表已反转部分的头</li>\n<li><code>current</code> 初始为 <code>head</code>，代表当前正在处理的节点</li>\n<li><code>next</code> 用于临时保存 <code>current.next</code>，防止断链后丢失后续节点</li>\n</ol>\n<p>每次迭代执行四步操作：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>保存 <code>current.next</code> 到 <code>next</code></li>\n<li>将 <code>current.next</code> 指向 <code>prev</code>（翻转指向）</li>\n<li><code>prev</code> 移动到 <code>current</code></li>\n<li><code>current</code> 移动到 <code>next</code></li>\n</ul>\n<p>当 <code>current</code> 为 <code>null</code> 时，<code>prev</code> 即为新的头节点。</p>\n<p><strong>方法二：递归</strong></p>\n<p>递归法的思路更加抽象：假设从第二个节点开始的子链表已经被反转，那么我们只需要让原来第二个节点的 <code>next</code> 指向第一个节点，并将第一个节点的 <code>next</code> 设为 <code>null</code>。</p>\n<p>递归终止条件：空链表或只有一个节点时，直接返回。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方法</th>\n<th>时间复杂度</th>\n<th>空间复杂度</th>\n<th>理解难度</th>\n<th>工程适用性</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>迭代（三指针）</td>\n<td>O(n)</td>\n<td>O(1)</td>\n<td>中等</td>\n<td>高（无栈溢出风险）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>递归</td>\n<td>O(n)</td>\n<td>O(n)</td>\n<td>较高</td>\n<td>中（受栈深度限制）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"代码实现\">代码实现</h2><p><strong>方法一：迭代（推荐）</strong></p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"function reverseList(head: ListNode | null): ListNode | null {&#10;  let prev: ListNode | null = null;&#10;  let current = head;&#10;&#10;  while (current !== null) {&#10;    const next = current.next;&#10;    current.next = prev;&#10;    prev = current;&#10;    current = next;&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  return prev;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> reverseList</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">head</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ListNode</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ListNode</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> prev</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ListNode</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> current </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> head;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  while</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (current </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!==</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> next</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> current.next;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    current.next </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> prev;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    prev </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> current;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    current </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> next;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> prev;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>每次循环的操作可以理解为：把当前节点从原链表&quot;摘下来&quot;，接到已反转链表的头部。这就像是在用&quot;头插法&quot;重新构建链表。</p>\n<p><strong>方法二：递归</strong></p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"function reverseListRecursive(head: ListNode | null): ListNode | null {&#10;  if (head === null || head.next === null) {&#10;    return head;&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  const newHead = reverseListRecursive(head.next);&#10;&#10;  head.next.next = head;&#10;  head.next = null;&#10;&#10;  return newHead;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> reverseListRecursive</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">head</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ListNode</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ListNode</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (head </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">===</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ||</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> head.next </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">===</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> head;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> newHead</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> reverseListRecursive</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(head.next);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  head.next.next </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> head;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  head.next </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> newHead;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>递归版本的关键在于理解 <code>head.next.next = head</code> 这一行：<code>head.next</code> 是反转前 <code>head</code> 的下一个节点，反转后它变成了 <code>head</code> 的前驱，所以让它的 <code>next</code> 指回 <code>head</code>。然后将 <code>head.next</code> 设为 <code>null</code>，断开原来的正向链接。</p>\n<p>可视化迭代过程：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"初始：1 → 2 → 3 → 4 → null&#10;      prev=null, current=1&#10;&#10;第1步：null ← 1    2 → 3 → 4 → null&#10;              prev=1, current=2&#10;&#10;第2步：null ← 1 ← 2    3 → 4 → null&#10;                   prev=2, current=3&#10;&#10;第3步：null ← 1 ← 2 ← 3    4 → null&#10;                        prev=3, current=4&#10;&#10;第4步：null ← 1 ← 2 ← 3 ← 4&#10;                             prev=4, current=null&#10;&#10;返回 prev = 4（新的头节点）\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>初始：1 → 2 → 3 → 4 → null</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      prev=null, current=1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>第1步：null ← 1    2 → 3 → 4 → null</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>              prev=1, current=2</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>第2步：null ← 1 ← 2    3 → 4 → null</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                   prev=2, current=3</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>第3步：null ← 1 ← 2 ← 3    4 → null</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                        prev=3, current=4</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>第4步：null ← 1 ← 2 ← 3 ← 4</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                             prev=4, current=null</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>返回 prev = 4（新的头节点）</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"复杂度分析\">复杂度分析</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方法</th>\n<th>时间复杂度</th>\n<th>空间复杂度</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>迭代</td>\n<td>O(n)</td>\n<td>O(1)</td>\n<td>仅使用三个指针变量</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>递归</td>\n<td>O(n)</td>\n<td>O(n)</td>\n<td>递归栈深度为 n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>迭代法在实际工程中更常用，因为它没有栈溢出的风险。反转链表是链表操作的&quot;基本功&quot;，建议务必做到闭眼写出迭代版本。掌握后可以继续挑战 LC #92（反转链表的指定区间）和 LC #25（K 个一组翻转），它们都是在本题基础上的扩展。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"LeetCode 206 反转链表","id":"leetcode-206-反转链表"},{"level":2,"text":"题目描述","id":"题目描述"},{"level":2,"text":"解题思路","id":"解题思路"},{"level":2,"text":"代码实现","id":"代码实现"},{"level":2,"text":"复杂度分析","id":"复杂度分析"}],"prev":{"title":"LeetCode 160 相交链表","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/leetcode-practice/easy-linked-list-stack-queue/lc0160-intersection-of-two-linked-lists"},"next":{"title":"LeetCode 20 有效的括号","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/leetcode-practice/easy-linked-list-stack-queue/lc0020-valid-parentheses"}}